1
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,910
This spring is full of spiritual power.

2
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,900
It's a great aid to cultivation.

3
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:28,810
Could this be the source?

4
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,620
How did they find this place?

5
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:33,610
You're awake?

6
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:37,090
Qi Fengyin?

7
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:38,730
Where are my clothes?

8
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,940
You're weak.

9
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,010
You have to soak here

10
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:43,900
to gain spiritual power.

11
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,580
So you stripped me?

12
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,050
You haven't seen a pretty woman

13
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,140
in 1,000 years on Mount Qihuang.

14
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,330
I should've been on my guard.

15
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,140
Taking advantage of me

16
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:52,970
while I was unconscious?

17
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,540
- How dare you...! - Shut up.

18
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:57,780
I have no interest in looking after you.

19
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,290
Youyou brought you here.

20
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:02,580
That black dragon lives here.

21
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,170
The foul energy here is so strong

22
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:06,060
that no one else can get near.

23
00:01:06,390 --> 00:01:07,290
I'm the only one

24
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,500
who can stay and watch over you.

25
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:18,290
Turn around and cover your eyes.

26
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,140
Don't turn back.

27
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:53,420
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

28
00:01:55,460 --> 00:02:01,420
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

29
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:06,700
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

30
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:17,940
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

31
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:25,060
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

32
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:32,940
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

33
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:40,980
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

34
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:49,100
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

35
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:55,660
[Blossom in Darkness]

36
00:02:55,660 --> 00:02:57,660
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

37
00:02:57,660 --> 00:03:00,660
[Episode 9]

38
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,010
I've thought it over.

39
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,410
I need to teach you a few

40
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:07,160
basic rules of conduct.

41
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,250
What rules?

42
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:14,060
You may be fairly handsome,

43
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:16,220
but you know nothing of human decency.

44
00:03:16,430 --> 00:03:17,180
Without any manners,

45
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,030
you're just

46
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,130
a beast in human skin.

47
00:03:19,390 --> 00:03:21,020
When I was soaking in the spring,

48
00:03:21,270 --> 00:03:22,560
any decent person would've known

49
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,220
to look away.

50
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,180
We're of opposite sexes.

51
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,280
You should've given me some privacy.

52
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:25,740
Understand?

53
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:28,730
Do you understand?

54
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,590
But I don't see

55
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:33,980
the difference.

56
00:03:35,470 --> 00:03:36,470
Take a good look!

57
00:03:36,470 --> 00:03:37,340
Of course there's a difference!

58
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:58,610
If what Yuanbao said is true

59
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,220
and that black dragon lives here,

60
00:04:02,590 --> 00:04:03,780
wouldn't you be as good as dead

61
00:04:04,310 --> 00:04:05,500
if you were unconscious again?

62
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,060
Even then,

63
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,170
should I still look away?

64
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,340
Well, obviously, my life

65
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:14,940
comes first.

66
00:04:17,630 --> 00:04:18,700
It depends on the situation.

67
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,460
You could've at least covered your eyes.

68
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:29,460
You call me

69
00:04:29,870 --> 00:04:31,290
a beast in human skin.

70
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,540
Is your dear Hao

71
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:35,660
a good man who follows the rules?

72
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,100
Why bring him up all of a sudden?

73
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:42,140
Hao is honorable

74
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,100
and a true gentleman.

75
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:45,460
He's nothing like you.

76
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:50,660
If everything he does is right,

77
00:04:51,510 --> 00:04:52,900
was he right to try to kill you

78
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,290
and take

79
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,220
your herb core?

80
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:58,920
Then should I

81
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,500
follow the rules like him,

82
00:05:00,890 --> 00:05:02,410
kill you right now,

83
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,540
and send you back to the immortal sects?

84
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,780
Whether I'm a human

85
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,190
or a beast,

86
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,780
as I've said,

87
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,990
I don't care what you or anyone else

88
00:05:26,870 --> 00:05:27,580
thinks of me.

89
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,290
That flower is all I care about.

90
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,700
Killing her myself

91
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,250
is all I live for.

92
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:42,340
This spring water

93
00:05:42,950 --> 00:05:43,780
is remarkable indeed.

94
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,020
But it seems

95
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:47,900
it can only offer temporary relief.

96
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,370
It can't cure my condition.

97
00:05:50,070 --> 00:05:51,290
Once I leave this spring,

98
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:53,490
the malice will hurt me again.

99
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,700
Are you making an artifact?

100
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,980
I've examined the soil

101
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,730
around this spring.

102
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,250
Using it as a conduit

103
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,220
will keep this artifact

104
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,700
connected to the spring.

105
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,250
Could it be

106
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,540
that the lake on Mount Qihuang

107
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,540
was created the same way?

108
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:18,780
Is that why

109
00:06:19,270 --> 00:06:20,410
they share the same source?

110
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:20,930
I don't know.

111
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:22,980
This artifact

112
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:24,540
will take half a day to finish.

113
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,020
Teach me to read in the meantime.

114
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,420
You have no interest in anything

115
00:06:42,420 --> 00:06:43,810
but the mystical flower.

116
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:45,420
Why bother learning to read?

117
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:47,460
Just teach me to read,

118
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:48,810
not how to behave.

119
00:06:52,870 --> 00:06:53,340
All right.

120
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:54,850
Then how about

121
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,410
calling me Master first?

122
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:58,490
I'll start your lessons right away.

123
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,290
All right.

124
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:00,800
Then I suppose I can

125
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,540
stop making this artifact.

126
00:07:01,870 --> 00:07:03,170
I'll just plant you here.

127
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:04,490
Whenever I find a wisp of malice,

128
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,710
I'll come back and water you.

129
00:07:05,710 --> 00:07:06,900
Watch closely!

130
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:19,780
This

131
00:07:20,390 --> 00:07:21,490
is your name,

132
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,370
Qi Fengyin.

133
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,660
And this

134
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:27,580
is my name.

135
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:30,580
[Yamao, Qi Fengyin]

136
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,050
Both our names have birds

137
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:32,930
in them.
[*Ya: a duck; Feng: a phoenix]

138
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:34,850
Why does yours

139
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:35,780
sound so much classier?

140
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:05,620
[Yamao, Qi Fengyin, Yamao]

141
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:06,930
Why are you called Yamao?

142
00:08:43,630 --> 00:08:44,180
Master,

143
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,340
I know what my name should be.

144
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,100
Yamao.
[*duck feather]

145
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:47,650
You've just taken human form.

146
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:48,420
You don't know much yet.

147
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:50,340
You can choose a name later.

148
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,300
I want to be called Yamao.

149
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:56,700
But that name

150
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,340
isn't very elegant.

151
00:09:04,790 --> 00:09:05,340
All right.

152
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:07,010
If you like it,

153
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:08,130
Yamao it is.

154
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:20,460
What am I doing?

155
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,170
Master's soul crystal

156
00:09:22,170 --> 00:09:23,340
is still in Qi Fengyin's hands.

157
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,200
Yet I just went

158
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:25,940
against Master's teachings

159
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:27,980
and tried to open up to him.

160
00:09:35,390 --> 00:09:36,060
If we

161
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,130
want to use this spring's power,

162
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,980
shouldn't we

163
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,460
tell the demons living here first?

164
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:43,370
I've made a deal with them.

165
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,650
But before we go,

166
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:47,700
please promise, sir,

167
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:49,370
that you'll save our lives.

168
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:51,850
The Saintess

169
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:54,100
created the Mystical Core with her divine power

170
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,340
to sustain Peach Blossom Paradise.

171
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:56,980
But that vile black dragon

172
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,370
has been slaughtering us demons

173
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:00,420
to use our souls in a blood sacrifice

174
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,250
and force the Mystical Core to appear.

175
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:04,530
Our suffering is beyond words.

176
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,490
You're so powerful, sir.

177
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,010
Please save us

178
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,340
and slay the black dragon!

179
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:13,130
No wonder this paradise

180
00:10:13,150 --> 00:10:14,130
has become such a foul place.

181
00:10:16,150 --> 00:10:17,010
So you agreed to help?

182
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:17,850
Of course.

183
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:22,580
I caught a glimpse of the black dragon.

184
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,460
I'd never felt such overwhelming power before.

185
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,580
This is serious.

186
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:29,010
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

187
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,180
Tell you sooner?

188
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:33,010
I'll be fighting a mighty ancient demon.

189
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,650
What good would telling you do?

190
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:36,980
Of course it would help.

191
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,060
I could stop you.

192
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,770
That's a vicious ancient demon

193
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,770
that's absorbed all of the paradise's spiritual power.

194
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,420
With your current strength,

195
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:47,010
the fight could go either way.

196
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,370
We need to learn

197
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:49,420
the dragon's habits first.

198
00:10:49,790 --> 00:10:51,700
We need to know what we're up against to win.

199
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:52,730
Besides,

200
00:10:53,750 --> 00:10:54,610
who says I'm useless?

201
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:55,580
We can

202
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:57,580
pick a windy, moonlit night

203
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:58,370
to ambush it.

204
00:10:58,630 --> 00:10:59,820
Even if you can't beat it,

205
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,180
I can get us out of there.

206
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:01,820
Forget it.

207
00:11:02,390 --> 00:11:03,370
If anything happened to me,

208
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,340
you'd be the first to try

209
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,180
to finish me off.

210
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:08,980
If it came to that,

211
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:10,300
I'd crush

212
00:11:10,390 --> 00:11:11,490
your master's soul crystal first.

213
00:11:19,510 --> 00:11:20,700
Once Yamao's problem is solved,

214
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,370
I'll take her and His Lordship

215
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:23,250
and get out of here.

216
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:24,890
Who cares about that black dragon?

217
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,770
That demon's devoured all the spiritual power here.

218
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,370
No one sane would risk their life fighting it.

219
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:33,370
Careful!

220
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,100
That spring water was hard to come by.

221
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,890
Don't spill it.

222
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,180
Then why don't you help me carry it?

223
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,700
I thought you were kind

224
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,890
and was starting to like you.

225
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:44,420
But you used the spring water

226
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:45,580
Yamao needed to survive

227
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,460
to force His Lordship to help you.

228
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,460
And now I'm stuck

229
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,420
doing your heavy lifting too.

230
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:52,650
I know I'm taking advantage of you.

231
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,580
But the foul energy here is so strong.

232
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:55,940
If the black dragon isn't killed,

233
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:57,770
every living thing on this island will die.

234
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,060
Youyou,

235
00:11:59,700 --> 00:12:00,770
yell at me all you want.

236
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,650
Oh, I will.

237
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:09,010
We're here.

238
00:12:18,550 --> 00:12:19,220
I'm back!

239
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,250
Come get some water!

240
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:21,730
Yuanbao's back!

241
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:22,940
We have water!

242
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:31,370
Be careful.

243
00:12:31,670 --> 00:12:32,180
Thank you.

244
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:33,820
- Thank you. - Here.

245
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,030
Thank you.

246
00:12:35,030 --> 00:12:35,820
Here, take two.

247
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,490
Thank you.

248
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:40,730
For generations, we demons here

249
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:41,980
have fed on spiritual power.

250
00:12:43,390 --> 00:12:44,180
Now

251
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,060
we're all dying.

252
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,340
We have no choice but to drink

253
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,300
the spring water to survive.

254
00:12:50,030 --> 00:12:51,530
I risk my life every time I fetch it.

255
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:52,610
Youyou,

256
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,850
thank you for helping me.

257
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:00,890
Thank you.

258
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:01,770
You're welcome.

259
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,730
If you can't survive here,

260
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:10,130
why don't you leave?

261
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:11,850
Couldn't you live just fine

262
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:12,940
in the outside world?

263
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:14,340
It's not that simple.

264
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:16,420
The black dragon

265
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,890
wants to use us in a blood sacrifice

266
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:19,370
to force the Mystical Core to appear.

267
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:21,940
It's already imprisoned many of our souls.

268
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,250
When the blood sacrifice takes place,

269
00:13:24,670 --> 00:13:26,220
those souls will be destroyed forever.

270
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:29,420
I'm the only one with enough strength left

271
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:30,580
to escape.

272
00:13:30,750 --> 00:13:32,250
How could I abandon everyone

273
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,610
just to save myself?

274
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,250
Oh, no! It's the black dragon!

275
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,320
You should be hiding!

276
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,100
Where are you going?

277
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:51,010
I have to lure it away.

278
00:13:51,010 --> 00:13:51,980
I can't let it find this place!

279
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:52,370
You...

280
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:54,180
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

281
00:14:06,670 --> 00:14:07,250
Yuanbao!

282
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:26,220
You vile demon!

283
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:27,820
With all your power,

284
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,890
you choose to attack your own kind?

285
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,580
Have you no shame?

286
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,010
Yamao,

287
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,130
are you feeling better?

288
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:46,070
Let's worry

289
00:14:46,070 --> 00:14:46,890
about staying alive first!

290
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:01,460
Why provoke it

291
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,530
instead of hiding?

292
00:15:07,390 --> 00:15:07,850
My Lord,

293
00:15:08,030 --> 00:15:09,700
the paradise's demons are all hiding in the woods.

294
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,030
If the dragon goes any farther,

295
00:15:11,030 --> 00:15:12,820
they'll all die!

296
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,490
Looks like we can't wait

297
00:15:27,510 --> 00:15:28,340
for your foolproof plan.

298
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:07,770
Youyou,

299
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:08,820
you're a mighty ancient demon.

300
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:09,770
Don't you know how

301
00:16:09,790 --> 00:16:10,820
to deal with that black dragon?

302
00:16:11,390 --> 00:16:12,850
I can think of something. I can!

303
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,890
Come on, think!

304
00:16:14,750 --> 00:16:15,340
I've got it!

305
00:16:15,510 --> 00:16:16,420
Since it's a demon,

306
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,180
rip out its demonic core,

307
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:18,130
and it'll die for sure.

308
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:18,850
Its demonic core?

309
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:22,530
Qi Fengyin!

310
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,340
Its demonic core is in its forehead!

311
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:51,130
What do we do, Yamao?

312
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:52,850
His Lordship can't get close to it!

313
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:57,700
Yamao!

314
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,290
My Lord!

315
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,220
Qi Fengyin!

316
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:17,980
Don't touch my blood.

317
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:18,980
Don't worry about me.

318
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,530
Worry about yourself.

319
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:28,660
You can have it back.

320
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:31,860
What are you doing?

321
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:33,730
Qi Fengyin?

322
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,330
Qi Fengyin!

323
00:18:37,790 --> 00:18:38,570
Qi Fengyin!

324
00:19:13,830 --> 00:19:14,490
Yamao.

325
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,900
How is His Lordship?

326
00:19:18,270 --> 00:19:19,140
He's badly hurt.

327
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:21,770
We gathered some medicine,

328
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:23,290
but I don't know if it'll help Mr. Qi.

329
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:24,770
He saved our lives.

330
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,140
We can't let anything happen to him.

331
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:26,980
Yuanbao,

332
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:28,980
you said you wanted to free the demon souls

333
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,400
sealed away by the black dragon.

334
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,620
We're rushing to build an altar.

335
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:34,010
Before tonight's ritual,

336
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:34,660
we must break the seal

337
00:19:34,730 --> 00:19:35,660
and release the soul flames.

338
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:36,940
Since time is short,

339
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,330
don't wait around here.

340
00:19:38,510 --> 00:19:39,570
Go build the altar.

341
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:41,380
But...

342
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:42,730
There's nothing

343
00:19:42,750 --> 00:19:43,770
you can do to help here.

344
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:45,380
Once my spiritual power returns tonight,

345
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:46,810
I'll heal him.

346
00:19:47,350 --> 00:19:48,330
Thank you, Yamao.

347
00:19:49,830 --> 00:19:50,770
Then I'll help

348
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:51,700
prepare the altar too.

349
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:52,940
Call if you need me.

350
00:19:53,030 --> 00:19:54,050
I'll come right back.

351
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:55,770
Let's go.

352
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,250
What am I doing?

353
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,980
He's unconscious

354
00:20:21,590 --> 00:20:22,380
and barely alive.

355
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,140
If I miss this chance,

356
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:26,050
I may never get another chance to kill him.

357
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:28,440
The world's malice is endless,

358
00:20:28,550 --> 00:20:30,470
and he keeps absorbing it to grow stronger.

359
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,700
I'm afraid it won't be long

360
00:20:31,880 --> 00:20:32,570
before Qi Fengyin

361
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:34,010
becomes the Devil Incarnate.

362
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:36,460
If I kill him,

363
00:20:37,070 --> 00:20:38,860
the immortal sects won't need to sacrifice me

364
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:40,380
to awaken the Saintess of the Tides.

365
00:20:41,270 --> 00:20:42,330
Master will be saved,

366
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,420
and the mystical flower won't keep me

367
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,730
bound to Qi Fengyin anymore.

368
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:48,900
For my sake and the world's,

369
00:20:49,750 --> 00:20:50,860
he must die.

370
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:06,730
Qi Fengyin!

371
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,660
You said you and I were different.

372
00:21:15,790 --> 00:21:17,250
But I don't think we are.

373
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,570
To know someone's true nature,

374
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,860
one should look at what they do,

375
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,380
not what they say.

376
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:29,980
Master once said,

377
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:34,090
"Those who do wrong without ill intent deserve no punishment."

378
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,530
Qi Fengyin,

379
00:21:37,790 --> 00:21:39,490
I believe you're good at heart.

380
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:45,570
- Yuanbao. - Yuanbao.

381
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:52,050
With the black dragon dead,

382
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:53,570
this place is finally starting

383
00:21:53,590 --> 00:21:54,810
to look like a paradise.

384
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:56,380
Yes.

385
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:58,330
At the Zi hour, when all things are renewed,

386
00:21:58,750 --> 00:21:59,980
we'll use the power of this ritual

387
00:22:00,070 --> 00:22:01,090
to break the black dragon's seal

388
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:02,530
and finally free

389
00:22:02,550 --> 00:22:03,570
all the demon soul flames

390
00:22:03,590 --> 00:22:04,490
it has imprisoned.

391
00:22:05,590 --> 00:22:06,770
You've helped them.

392
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,530
You can write down a wish

393
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,460
and let the soul flames carry it away.

394
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,330
It can bring you good fortune.

395
00:22:10,830 --> 00:22:11,330
Really?

396
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,570
When the time comes,

397
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,090
the flames will fill the sky.

398
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:19,860
It'll be beautiful.

399
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,700
What's that sound?

400
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:44,900
Here, tie this up.

401
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,290
Qi Fengyin!

402
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:31,970
I just managed

403
00:23:31,970 --> 00:23:33,010
to pull you back from death's door.

404
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:34,770
What are you doing?

405
00:23:35,580 --> 00:23:36,520
Where's Youyou?

406
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:37,140
Youyou?

407
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:39,460
She went to the altar with Yuanbao.

408
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:40,900
Worry about yourself

409
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,490
first.

410
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:44,220
Why is your dark energy out of control again?

411
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,250
The black markings are back too.

412
00:23:45,790 --> 00:23:46,700
They haven't appeared in so long.

413
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,010
Hurry and suppress them.

414
00:23:49,590 --> 00:23:50,750
Something's wrong with the altar.

415
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:52,980
They've trapped Youyou there

416
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,290
to burn her as a sacrifice.

417
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,460
Burn her as a sacrifice?

418
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:00,380
What is he talking about?

419
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:09,460
That spot's still empty.

420
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:10,810
- All right. - All right.

421
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:12,490
Keep it up, everyone!

422
00:24:16,510 --> 00:24:17,620
Mr. Qi, you're awake?

423
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:22,570
Thank you for saving us

424
00:24:22,790 --> 00:24:24,010
and slaying the black dragon!

425
00:24:27,270 --> 00:24:28,260
Move.

426
00:24:30,270 --> 00:24:30,660
Well...

427
00:24:33,550 --> 00:24:34,250
Mr. Qi,

428
00:24:34,290 --> 00:24:35,380
are you going to the altar?

429
00:24:36,110 --> 00:24:37,860
One of my people is being held inside.

430
00:24:40,510 --> 00:24:41,530
You mean Youyou?

431
00:24:41,830 --> 00:24:42,920
She was feeling tired

432
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:43,900
and went back to rest.

433
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:44,530
Mr. Qi,

434
00:24:44,550 --> 00:24:45,490
you must be mistaken.

435
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:46,940
How could she be inside the altar?

436
00:24:47,350 --> 00:24:47,940
Qi Fengyin,

437
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:49,770
you don't seem yourself.

438
00:24:49,830 --> 00:24:50,980
Let's go back, all right?

439
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:59,500
She's inside the altar.

440
00:25:00,350 --> 00:25:00,940
Mr. Qi,

441
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:02,290
countless demon souls

442
00:25:02,290 --> 00:25:03,460
depend on this altar to pass on.

443
00:25:03,920 --> 00:25:04,770
If it's destroyed,

444
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:06,570
they'll vanish for good.

445
00:25:07,030 --> 00:25:08,050
Even though you saved us

446
00:25:08,070 --> 00:25:08,860
by killing the black dragon,

447
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:10,620
I won't let you destroy the altar.

448
00:25:11,110 --> 00:25:11,730
Qi Fengyin,

449
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:12,770
let's look for Youyou first

450
00:25:12,790 --> 00:25:13,810
to make sure.

451
00:25:15,110 --> 00:25:16,660
I'll say this one last time.

452
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,180
Move.

453
00:25:18,830 --> 00:25:19,620
I won't move.

454
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,460
If you want to destroy the altar,

455
00:25:23,550 --> 00:25:24,420
you'll have to step

456
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,050
over my dead body.

457
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:32,660
- Yuanbao! - Yuanbao!

458
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:35,050
Put your demonic core away first.

459
00:25:35,270 --> 00:25:35,620
You...

460
00:25:54,110 --> 00:25:55,290
Have you lost your mind?

461
00:25:55,590 --> 00:25:57,290
I know what I'm doing.

462
00:26:16,590 --> 00:26:18,050
You slaughtered someone innocent

463
00:26:20,030 --> 00:26:21,660
over a baseless hunch?

464
00:26:23,510 --> 00:26:24,380
I almost forgot.

465
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,090
You're a devil, after all.

466
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:38,730
He told me plainly

467
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,090
not to expect anything from him.

468
00:26:40,270 --> 00:26:41,700
I was so full of myself.

469
00:26:42,590 --> 00:26:43,660
I had neither techniques to rely on

470
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:45,770
nor Master's extraordinary talent,

471
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:46,980
yet I thought

472
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:49,330
I could tame a devil like him.

473
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,220
I thought a few words from me

474
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,860
could set him on the right path.

475
00:26:55,070 --> 00:26:57,940
I should've killed him

476
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:59,700
when he lay wounded and dying.

477
00:27:01,590 --> 00:27:02,620
I knew this would happen.

478
00:27:04,270 --> 00:27:05,860
I never should've let him live this long.

479
00:27:09,790 --> 00:27:11,250
I have Master's soul crystal now,

480
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:14,460
and he's too badly hurt to keep an eye on me.

481
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:15,730
Now

482
00:27:17,270 --> 00:27:18,420
is my only chance to leave.

483
00:27:57,680 --> 00:27:58,940
Where am I?

484
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:22,730
I thought you had no powers,

485
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:24,140
so I nearly let my guard down

486
00:28:24,790 --> 00:28:26,250
and almost let you ruin my plan.

487
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:33,620
Yuanbao?

488
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:38,890
But even if you escaped,

489
00:28:38,890 --> 00:28:39,980
it wouldn't change a thing.

490
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:42,050
Qi Fengyin is weak from his injuries,

491
00:28:42,510 --> 00:28:43,290
and that little herb spirit,

492
00:28:43,310 --> 00:28:44,860
the only one who could help him,

493
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,810
has abandoned him.

494
00:28:51,750 --> 00:28:52,380
As for you,

495
00:28:53,110 --> 00:28:53,810
you useless demon,

496
00:28:53,830 --> 00:28:55,220
what could you possibly do?

497
00:28:57,790 --> 00:28:58,940
You lied to me.

498
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:01,530
You lied to Yamao and His Lordship too.

499
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,490
We helped you drive off the black dragon

500
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:04,500
and protect the demons.

501
00:29:04,920 --> 00:29:06,330
Is this how you repay our kindness?

502
00:29:07,030 --> 00:29:07,900
What demons?

503
00:29:12,590 --> 00:29:14,090
Aren't they all in there?

504
00:29:20,110 --> 00:29:21,770
You dared to call me a vile demon

505
00:29:22,550 --> 00:29:23,940
and a piece of trash.

506
00:29:24,070 --> 00:29:25,330
Once I've killed Qi Fengyin,

507
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,700
I'll deal with you.

508
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:35,900
You vile demon!

509
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:37,220
With all your power,

510
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:38,290
you choose to attack your own kind?

511
00:29:44,590 --> 00:29:45,620
She's the black dragon!

512
00:29:59,270 --> 00:30:00,900
Oh, Qi Fengyin,

513
00:30:01,550 --> 00:30:02,620
you got yourself hurt like this

514
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:03,770
for those two worthless fools.

515
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:05,330
But who cares

516
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:06,940
whether you live or die?

517
00:30:32,030 --> 00:30:33,250
Why the flowers?

518
00:30:34,750 --> 00:30:36,940
A sacrifice should be a solemn affair.

519
00:30:40,110 --> 00:30:41,010
You wake up,

520
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:42,330
and that's all you want to ask?

521
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:43,860
Aren't you curious who I am

522
00:30:44,550 --> 00:30:46,730
or why I'm doing this?

523
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:48,810
You went to all this trouble

524
00:30:49,830 --> 00:30:51,290
to bind me with a dragon's claws

525
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:53,180
for the Mystical Core, didn't you?

526
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:56,250
Clever.

527
00:30:56,790 --> 00:30:57,530
But

528
00:30:58,350 --> 00:31:00,050
I still have you in the palm of my hand.

529
00:31:01,590 --> 00:31:03,180
The Mystical Core is hidden in this paradise.

530
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:04,770
Only the Saintess of the Tides

531
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:06,460
can make it appear.

532
00:31:07,030 --> 00:31:07,620
So

533
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:09,900
I had to use the energy of bloodshed

534
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:11,770
to counter the Void Arts.

535
00:31:12,750 --> 00:31:13,950
Now I'll add

536
00:31:13,950 --> 00:31:15,330
your vicious, vengeful soul,

537
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:17,940
the world's greatest evil,

538
00:31:18,310 --> 00:31:20,010
to counter the magic of the Saintess of the Tides.

539
00:31:20,550 --> 00:31:21,490
Isn't it brilliant?

540
00:31:26,830 --> 00:31:27,980
You're about to die,

541
00:31:28,640 --> 00:31:30,090
yet you show no fear.

542
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:31,770
The whole world wants me dead.

543
00:31:33,550 --> 00:31:35,460
It's been that way for 1,000 years.

544
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:36,620
I'm used to it.

545
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:38,420
Is that so?

546
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:41,380
But 1,000 years ago,

547
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:43,090
things were different for you.

548
00:31:44,830 --> 00:31:46,250
She left you all alone.

549
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:48,900
How pitiful.

550
00:31:49,550 --> 00:31:50,940
You know about my past?

551
00:31:55,270 --> 00:31:56,250
She didn't even let you

552
00:31:56,270 --> 00:31:57,010
keep your memories?

553
00:32:01,590 --> 00:32:02,420
It seems

554
00:32:02,830 --> 00:32:03,620
you're dying to know

555
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,730
what happened back then.

556
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,460
Then I'll...

557
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:10,570
tell you nothing.

558
00:32:11,310 --> 00:32:12,530
If you die without answers,

559
00:32:12,790 --> 00:32:14,050
you'll be even more resentful, won't you?

560
00:32:23,110 --> 00:32:24,290
Someone's broken in.

561
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,140
Of all times, why now?

562
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:51,530
You still had enough strength to escape?

563
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:53,180
You rotten flood dragon,

564
00:32:53,590 --> 00:32:54,530
die!

565
00:33:04,830 --> 00:33:05,730
I'm doomed!

566
00:33:06,270 --> 00:33:07,770
Yamao's so unreliable.

567
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:09,700
I'm going to die trapped in here!

568
00:33:12,070 --> 00:33:12,770
Bad-mouthing me again?

569
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:13,660
I shouldn't have come.

570
00:33:14,320 --> 00:33:15,140
Yamao?

571
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,730
Yamao!

572
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:20,220
I knew

573
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:22,290
you wouldn't really abandon us!

574
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:25,730
Do I look

575
00:33:25,750 --> 00:33:27,010
like a coward who runs from a fight?

576
00:33:27,030 --> 00:33:27,330
No.

577
00:33:27,510 --> 00:33:28,090
Besides,

578
00:33:28,550 --> 00:33:29,180
I was the one

579
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:30,140
who chose to save Qi Fengyin.

580
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:31,330
I should find out for myself

581
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:32,900
whether he was right or wrong.

582
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:35,700
I pretended to leave Peach Blossom Paradise,

583
00:33:36,270 --> 00:33:37,290
but I doubled back

584
00:33:37,290 --> 00:33:38,330
to find out where you were.

585
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:40,380
But then I saw

586
00:33:41,030 --> 00:33:42,180
Yuanbao, who was supposed to be dead,

587
00:33:42,790 --> 00:33:43,620
walk brazenly

588
00:33:43,640 --> 00:33:44,660
into Qi Fengyin's room.

589
00:33:46,370 --> 00:33:47,180
Yamao,

590
00:33:47,510 --> 00:33:49,050
you have to get His Lordship out.

591
00:34:13,480 --> 00:34:14,530
I thought you'd left.

592
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:16,340
How could I just abandon you?

593
00:34:17,030 --> 00:34:17,980
You wretched devil.

594
00:34:18,230 --> 00:34:19,170
You kept saying

595
00:34:19,280 --> 00:34:20,010
if anything happened to you,

596
00:34:20,030 --> 00:34:21,380
you'd crush my master's soul crystal.

597
00:34:21,670 --> 00:34:22,690
But when it mattered,

598
00:34:23,070 --> 00:34:24,420
you gave it back to me.

599
00:34:25,150 --> 00:34:25,780
I refuse to believe

600
00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:26,740
that you'd suddenly lose your mind.

601
00:34:27,230 --> 00:34:28,300
What if you're wrong to trust...?

602
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:29,340
Enough with the what-ifs!

603
00:34:29,880 --> 00:34:30,690
I've gone to so much trouble

604
00:34:30,710 --> 00:34:31,650
to save you time and again.

605
00:34:31,990 --> 00:34:33,050
Your life belongs to me.

606
00:34:33,160 --> 00:34:34,690
I decide whether you live or die!

607
00:34:50,920 --> 00:34:51,780
I can't put this fire out.

608
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:53,770
If you don't leave now,

609
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:55,530
you'll be one crispy herb.

610
00:34:55,550 --> 00:34:56,050
Shut up!

611
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,740
If you can't help, keep quiet.

612
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,260
No need to struggle like this.

613
00:35:02,710 --> 00:35:03,340
Stand back.

614
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,050
It's the Mystical Core.

615
00:36:04,190 --> 00:36:04,820
You didn't leave?

616
00:36:12,400 --> 00:36:13,460
You worked together to trick me

617
00:36:13,480 --> 00:36:14,610
into swallowing a fake Mystical Core?

618
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,170
You could hide your identity,

619
00:36:16,840 --> 00:36:18,130
but not your malice.

620
00:36:18,440 --> 00:36:19,300
The black markings are back too.

621
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:20,780
They haven't appeared in so long.

622
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:22,130
Hurry and suppress them.

623
00:36:28,190 --> 00:36:29,210
Mr. Qi, you're awake?

624
00:36:29,710 --> 00:36:31,260
Blame your own arrogance and recklessness.

625
00:36:31,840 --> 00:36:32,940
You thought you could fool everyone.

626
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:41,300
Qi Fengyin,

627
00:36:42,710 --> 00:36:44,780
I know everything about your past,

628
00:36:45,800 --> 00:36:47,110
and I know you'll suffer

629
00:36:47,110 --> 00:36:48,530
an even worse fate than mine.

630
00:36:49,110 --> 00:36:50,740
You want your malice back, huh?

631
00:36:52,070 --> 00:36:53,090
Then take it!

632
00:36:57,110 --> 00:36:57,900
What have you done?

633
00:36:58,030 --> 00:36:58,780
This venomous fang

634
00:36:58,800 --> 00:37:00,260
holds 1,000 years of my memories.

635
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,460
Once the venom seeps in,

636
00:37:03,190 --> 00:37:04,420
you'll see

637
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:05,570
it's all a lie.

638
00:37:06,030 --> 00:37:07,420
You've been wrong about everything!

639
00:37:22,710 --> 00:37:23,690
It's the Mystical Core.

640
00:37:25,350 --> 00:37:29,820
I can finally become a true dragon.

641
00:37:46,110 --> 00:37:46,980
Wicked woman.

642
00:37:47,230 --> 00:37:48,820
She had to pull one last trick before dying.

643
00:37:49,360 --> 00:37:51,210
Can you get that fang out?

644
00:37:51,550 --> 00:37:52,010
Don't worry.

645
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:53,090
It can't hurt me.

646
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,570
These are the dead islanders' souls.

647
00:38:14,070 --> 00:38:14,980
So the black dragon's death

648
00:38:15,510 --> 00:38:16,740
is all it takes to free them.

649
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:18,340
Yamao,

650
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:19,740
conjure up some paper and a brush!

651
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:24,650
Here.

652
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:26,300
My Lord.

653
00:38:27,510 --> 00:38:28,860
We've helped these demon souls.

654
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:29,570
As they pass on,

655
00:38:29,590 --> 00:38:30,420
we can write down our wishes

656
00:38:30,440 --> 00:38:31,050
and let these souls

657
00:38:31,070 --> 00:38:31,610
carry them away.

658
00:38:31,710 --> 00:38:32,570
It can bring us good fortune.

659
00:38:57,590 --> 00:38:58,870
I forgot you only know

660
00:38:58,870 --> 00:38:59,940
how to write your own name.

661
00:39:00,190 --> 00:39:00,860
I'll teach you.

662
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:22,490
What does it mean?

663
00:39:23,550 --> 00:39:26,490
It means blooming and bearing fruit.

664
00:39:26,630 --> 00:39:27,050
Isn't that

665
00:39:27,110 --> 00:39:28,650
exactly what you want?

666
00:39:31,510 --> 00:39:31,980
All done?

667
00:39:39,660 --> 00:39:42,700
[Kill all immortal jerks]

668
00:39:42,700 --> 00:39:46,100
[May Master be safe]

669
00:39:49,460 --> 00:39:51,100
[May Master be safe]

670
00:39:53,020 --> 00:39:58,860
[Be good]

671
00:40:02,100 --> 00:40:04,460
[Be good]

672
00:40:04,460 --> 00:40:05,980
[May Master be safe]

673
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:34,300
Don't you

674
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:35,460
owe me quite a few explanations?

675
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:42,460
Why did you bring me here?

676
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:52,340
You gave me back the soul crystal

677
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:53,460
and even gave me time

678
00:40:53,480 --> 00:40:54,490
to leave on my own.

679
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:55,780
Weren't you afraid

680
00:40:56,190 --> 00:40:57,530
I'd disappear with the mystical flower?

681
00:41:24,670 --> 00:41:25,570
I'm not afraid of losing you.

682
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:29,380
Why?

683
00:41:30,360 --> 00:41:31,340
Wherever you go,

684
00:41:32,440 --> 00:41:33,610
I can always find you.

685
00:41:50,480 --> 00:41:52,530
You won't escape this time.

686
00:41:52,710 --> 00:41:53,530
The Mystical Core?

687
00:41:55,190 --> 00:41:56,420
Good thing you were there.

688
00:42:05,110 --> 00:42:06,090
Master!

689
00:42:06,920 --> 00:42:08,090
How did you turn into a woman?

690
00:42:28,940 --> 00:42:32,980
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

691
00:42:33,220 --> 00:42:36,660
♪So many longings♪

692
00:42:37,340 --> 00:42:39,420
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

693
00:42:39,620 --> 00:42:44,620
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

694
00:42:45,540 --> 00:42:49,580
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

695
00:42:49,820 --> 00:42:53,260
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

696
00:42:53,940 --> 00:42:56,020
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

697
00:42:56,220 --> 00:43:03,620
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

698
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:08,700
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

699
00:43:08,940 --> 00:43:12,620
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

700
00:43:13,260 --> 00:43:16,820
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

701
00:43:17,140 --> 00:43:21,300
♪Still waits to come true♪

702
00:43:21,540 --> 00:43:25,220
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

703
00:43:25,780 --> 00:43:29,420
♪I'll stay by your side♪

704
00:43:29,900 --> 00:43:33,500
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

705
00:43:33,740 --> 00:43:41,060
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

706
